# <type>(<scope>): <subject>   (max 72 chars, imperative mood — "add" not "added")
#
# <body — the WHY, not the WHAT. Wrap at 100 chars. Optional for trivial changes.>
#
# --- type must be one of ---
# feat      new capability
# fix       bug fix
# refactor  no behaviour change
# perf      performance improvement
# test      adding/fixing tests only
# docs      documentation only
# build     dependency/tooling/CI changes
# chore     everything else (formatting, housekeeping)
#
# --- scope examples (this repo's domain modules) ---
# auth, users, videos, questions, assignments, learning, reports,
# ui, db, docs, ci
